error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `name`, which borrows it

  9 │             name = Path.fileName("/a/b.txt")
    │                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
    │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough

error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `rel`, which borrows it

  10 │             rel = Path.relative(from: "/a", to: "/a/b")
     │                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of
     │                                                         its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
